[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3774559019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115157#issuecomment-3774559019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115157","id":3774559019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7g-zMr","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T19:22:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T19:22:37Z","body":"I'd really hate to expose yet another reload mechanism, given that we already have a huge largely undocumented amount of those (`Script::reload`, `CACHE_MODE_REPLACE`, `ScriptLanguage::reload_tool_script`, `ScriptLanguage::reload_all_scripts`, `ScriptLanguage::reload_scripts`). So I'd like to propose a third option.\r\n\r\nWhen we look at the implementation of `Script::reload_from_file`, we see what it actually does: it loads the resource from disk bypassing the cache. Then it copies the source code into the existing instance and reloads it.\r\n\r\nFor GDScript `ScriptLanguage::reload_tool_script` and `ScriptLanguage::reload_scripts` both already reload the script content from the filesystem. If, within `Script::reload_from_disk`, we replace the call to `Script::reload` with `ScriptLanguage::reload_scripts`, then all used methods reload from disk and we can simply remove the source code aspect from the method.\r\n\r\nWe would document, that `ScriptLanguage::reload_tool_script` and `ScriptLanguage::reload_scripts` are responsible for refreshing the script content from disk and the specifics of that would be up to the implementation.\r\n\r\nThis obviously needs confirmation from C#, I can't verify whether it works the same way as GDScript here. And sadly those interfaces are mostly defined by how they are currently used.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3774559019/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775382436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115157#issuecomment-3775382436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115157","id":3775382436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hB8Ok","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T23:13:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T23:13:03Z","body":"Great suggestion @HolonProduction. Just a brief skim, I believe this will work for CSharp, but it would be great to have someone double check as I don't have a way to test the mono builds atm.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775382436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775661051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115157#issuecomment-3775661051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115157","id":3775661051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hDAP7","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T01:10:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T01:10:20Z","body":"In C#, we don't really care about the contents of the source code files, since it's a compiled language. And regardless of whether you are reloading one or multiple scripts, we always reload the entire assembly. So I think the changes in 17c851761c04f63e6fe566a4d177120cbb5ef2d2 are safe, but I haven't actually tested it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775661051/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3849624264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115157#issuecomment-3849624264","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115157","id":3849624264,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ldJrI","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false